<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said on Friday it upgraded its rating on the shares of Millipore Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock added 1-3/4 to 47-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
